# Docker build context is the repository root (see engine/Dockerfile). Send only what the image
# needs: the engine package and the three demo seed files. Everything else is excluded.
*
!engine/pyproject.toml
!engine/README.md
!engine/vectorforge/
!web/data/demo/seed.json
!web/data/demo/docs.json
!web/data/demo/docs.bin
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
